sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 用户
    participant Screen as CloudBackupScreen
    participant VM as CloudBackupViewModel
    participant Tgt as BaiduPanTarget
    participant Auth as BaiduDeviceCodeAuth
    participant Api as BaiduPanApi
    participant BAIDU as openapi.baidu.com
    participant Store as EncryptedCredentialStore

    Note over User,Store: 场景1：百度网盘 设备码扫码授权

    User->>Screen: 点击「登录百度网盘」
    Screen->>VM: startAuth("baidu")
    VM->>Tgt: startDeviceCodeAuth()
    Tgt->>Auth: requestDeviceCode(clientId)
    Auth->>BAIDU: POST /oauth/2.0/device/code
    BAIDU-->>Auth: {device_code, user_code, qrcode_url, expires_in, interval}
    Auth-->>Tgt: DeviceCodeSession
    Tgt-->>VM: 返回二维码URL + device_code
    VM-->>Screen: 打开 BaiduAuthDialog
    Screen->>User: WebView 展示二维码（附 user_code 提示）

    loop 轮询 interval 秒，最长 expires_in
        Screen->>VM: pollToken()
        VM->>Tgt: pollToken(device_code)
        Tgt->>Auth: pollToken(device_code)
        Auth->>BAIDU: POST /oauth/2.0/token (grant_type=device_token)
        alt 用户已扫码并确认授权
            BAIDU-->>Auth: {access_token, refresh_token, expires_in}
            Auth-->>Tgt: AuthResult(success)
            Tgt->>Store: save("baidu", access_token+refresh_token+expiresAt)
            Tgt-->>VM: 授权成功
            VM-->>Screen: 关闭弹窗，刷新状态
        else 等待中（pending / expired_token）
            BAIDU-->>Auth: 错误码（不致命）
            Auth-->>Tgt: AuthResult(waiting)
            Tgt-->>VM: 继续轮询
        else 用户拒绝 / 超时
            BAIDU-->>Auth: 错误码（致命）
            Auth-->>Tgt: AuthResult(failed, 原因)
            Tgt-->>VM: 授权失败
            VM-->>Screen: 提示错误
    end
end

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 用户
    participant Screen as CloudBackupScreen
    participant VM as CloudBackupViewModel
    participant Tgt as AliPanTarget
    participant Web as AliPanWebViewAuth
    participant ALI as aliyundrive.com / openapi.alipan.com
    participant Store as EncryptedCredentialStore

    Note over User,Store: 场景2：阿里云盘 refresh_token 获取与自动刷新

    User->>Screen: 点击「登录阿里云盘」
    Screen->>VM: startAuth("aliyun")
    VM->>Tgt: startAuth()
    Tgt->>Web: openLoginWebView()
    Web->>ALI: WebView 加载 aliyundrive.com 登录页
    User->>Web: 完成网页登录
    Web->>Web: 尝试截取（localStorage.token / 跳转URL参数）
    alt 自动截取成功
        Web-->>Tgt: refreshToken
    else 自动截取失败
        User->>VM: 手动粘贴 refresh_token（TOKEN_PASTE 兜底）
        VM->>Tgt: setRefreshToken(pasted)
    end
    Tgt->>Store: save("aliyun", refresh_token)
    Tgt->>ALI: POST /oauth/access_token (grant_type=refresh_token)
    ALI-->>Tgt: {access_token, refresh_token, expires_in}
    Tgt->>Store: save("aliyun", access_token+refresh_token+expiresAt)
    Tgt-->>VM: 授权完成
    VM-->>Screen: 刷新为已授权状态

    Note over Tgt,ALI: 备份时自动刷新（token 过期兜底）
    Tgt->>Tgt: ensureAccessToken()（校验 expiresAt，过期则刷新）

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Trigger as 用户点击立即备份 / BackupWorker
    participant Engine as BackupEngine
    participant Store as BackupTaskStore(JSON)
    participant Reg as ProviderRegistry
    participant Tgt as BackupTarget(百度/阿里/WebDAV族)
    participant Up as ChunkedUploader
    participant Api as BaiduPanApi/AliPanApi
    participant FS as 本地文件系统

    Note over Trigger,FS: 场景3：备份任务队列执行（含分片上传与断点续传）

    Trigger->>Engine: runQueue()
    Engine->>Store: load() → List<BackupTask>
    Engine->>Reg: get(targetId)
    Engine->>Tgt: prepareRemote()（MKCOL / 建目录 / 建 /apps/XInvox）
    Tgt-->>Engine: Result.success

    loop 每个 PENDING 任务
        Engine->>Store: upsert(status=UPLOADING)
        Engine->>Tgt: exists(remotePath)
        alt 远端已存在
            Engine->>Store: upsert(status=DONE, bytesDone=size, skipped)
        else 不存在
            Engine->>Tgt: uploadFile(local, remotePath, progress)
            alt 支持分片（百度/阿里）
                Tgt->>Up: computeSha1(file)
                Tgt->>Tgt: ensureAccessToken()
                Tgt->>Api: 创建上传会话（百度 superfile / 阿里 create+part_urls）
                alt 阿里秒传命中（content_hash 匹配）
                    Api-->>Tgt: exist=true，无需上传
                else 正常分片
                    Api-->>Tgt: sessionId + partUrls
                    Tgt->>Up: split(file, chunkSize)
                    loop 每个分片
                        Tgt->>Api: 上传分片（百度 partseq / 阿里 PUT part_url）
                        Api-->>Tgt: 分片md5/etag
                        Tgt->>Up: 记录分片收据到 resumeState
                        Tgt-->>Engine: onProgress(bytesDone)
                        Engine->>Store: upsert(bytesDone 增量落盘)
                    end
                    Tgt->>Api: complete（百度 create / 阿里 complete）
                    Api-->>Tgt: 文件已创建
                end
            else 走 WebDAV 整文件 PUT（123 / CD2 / 高级）
                Tgt->>FS: 读取文件流
                Tgt-->>Engine: onProgress(bytesDone)
            end
            Tgt-->>Engine: UploadReceipt
            Engine->>Store: upsert(status=DONE, attempt+1)
        end
    end

    alt 单任务失败且未达最大重试
        Engine->>Store: upsert(status=PENDING, attempt+1, errorMessage)
        Engine->>Engine: scheduleRetry(指数退避 30s/2m/10m)
    else 重试耗尽
        Engine->>Store: upsert(status=FAILED)
    end

    Engine-->>Trigger: BackupSummary(uploaded, skipped, failed)
    Trigger-->>Engine: （WorkManager 场景）BackupWorker 结束 → setForeground 通知更新
